    {
      "id": "location_ChIJBachocBasqueFarmPlaceholder",
      "name": "Camping Bachoc a la Ferme Pays Basque",
      "description": "Farm-based campground in the French Basque countryside, rated 4.8. Quieter, more personal, less polished-touristic than the alternatives. One of the strongest hidden-gem matches on the whole route - the kind of small, family-run camp that fits the Snow Peak / Basecamps / wecamp sensibility without the brand. Good access to the French Basque coast (Guethary, Biarritz, Saint-Jean-de-Luz) and bus/train access back to San Sebastian as a day trip.",
