    {
      "id": "location_ChIJsZYzrlc6sRIRwO1-PScYzUw",
      "name": "Camping Beauregard Plage",
      "description": "Family-oriented campground directly on the beach in Marseillan-Plage (Bassin de Thau / Sete area). Rated 4.3 across 1200+ reviews, with premium pitches that include their own private shower and toilet. Abundant shade from pines, clean facilities, and direct beach access on one side and the resort amenities on the other. Much calmer than Cap d'Agde and much more authentic than the Sete port campgrounds. Good 2-night base for Sete market, Mont Saint-Clair viewpoint, and Bassin de Thau oysters.",
