      "name": "Tiramisu-Gelateria",
      "description": "4.9-rated hidden-gem gelateria in Cartagena's old town on Calle Jabonerias. Creamy, generous scoops, English-speaking staff, slushies and coffee too. Perfect afternoon break while walking Cartagena's Roman theatre and old town.",
