    {
      "id": "location_ChIJc0-KcqYKFg0R-Si5hXbKf2k",
      "name": "Camping Caceres",
      "description": "Well-run 129-pitch campground ~2km west of Caceres UNESCO old town, rated 4.4 with 3,400+ reviews. Each pitch has its own private sanitary block (shower, toilet, washbasin) - unusual and excellent. Pool, restaurant, good WiFi, bus stop opposite the gate into town. Strong 2-night base for the Extremadura leg.",
