    {
      "id": "pl_trujillo_town",
      "name": "Trujillo",
      "description": "Hilltop conquistador town between Caceres and Monfrague. Plaza Mayor with the equestrian statue of Pizarro, medieval castle, storks on every roof. Smaller and quieter than Caceres, very photogenic, easy half-day with kids.",
