      "name": "Restaurante Dos Orillas Trujillo",
      "description": "4.7-rated restaurant hidden in Trujillo's old center, with a stunning plant-filled courtyard that stays several degrees cooler than outdoors. Perfect lunch stop on the Caceres base day or on the way to Salamanca. Small seasonal menu, local ingredients, very attentive staff.",
