      "note": "Base day in Provence (day 2 of 2). Morning: Arles (Roman amphitheatre, Saturday market if timing works), then afternoon Les Baux-de-Provence. End with Glaces de Maitre Artisan ice cream in Arles - unusual Provencal flavors (fig, lavender, cassis).",
