      "sleep_location_id": "location_ChIJEcO6yQphthIRA39hbmBWb4U",
      "note": "Short transfer day from Provence to the Camargue wetlands. Quick morning stop at Fontvieille's Sentier des Moulins, then Parc Ornithologique de Pont-de-Gau (flamingos at eye level, wooden walkways - the best kid stop in the region). Settle in at Camping de la Brise, evening walk in Saintes-Maries-de-la-Mer.",
